{"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Framework","modules":[{"name":"Swami"}],"role":"collection","title":"Swami","externalID":"Swami","symbolKind":"module"},"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[[]]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An Origami → SwiftUI translator: a deterministic parser reads Facebook’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".origami"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"patch graph into a semantic IR, and a codegen writes that IR out as SwiftUI. Swami"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is also the patch-matched helper library that fills gaps between Origami patches"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and native SwiftUI — one helper per Origami patch, named after the patch, sized by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s patch surface. Every pattern that lands is a deliverable, verified against"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s own render, and shipped as a DocC-embedded example."}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"topicSections":[{"anchor":"Reference","title":"Reference","identifiers":["doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/OrigamiMappings","doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Beats"]},{"anchor":"Helpers","title":"Helpers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction","doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Drag"]},{"anchor":"Examples","title":"Examples","identifiers":["doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/TouchOrigamiExampleView","doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_DragView"]},{"generated":true,"anchor":"Articles","title":"Articles","identifiers":["doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_Drag"]},{"generated":true,"anchor":"Extended-Modules","title":"Extended Modules","identifiers":["doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/SwiftUICore"]}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentat